💭 THE ETERNAL REALITY
When the books are opened, loyalty without truth will burn like straw;
truth spoken in love will shine like gold.

“If ye continue in my word, then are ye my disciples indeed;
And ye shall know the truth, and the truth shall make you free.”
🔗 https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John+8%3A31-32&version=KJV
